    "difficulty": 12,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Skulk</h3>\n<p><em>A cunning scoundrel skilled in both poisons and ambushing.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong> Anticipate, get paid, kill, taint food and water</p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 12 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 4/9 | <strong>HP:</strong> 4 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 4</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +3 | <strong>Weapon:</strong> Poisoned Dagger: Close | 1d4+1 physical</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Intrusion +2</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Deadly Venom - Passive</strong>: Targets who mark HP from the Assassin&#39;s attacks are Vulnerable until they clear an HP.</p>\n<p><strong>Precision - Passive</strong>: The Assassin has Advantage if they are Cloaked.</p>\n<p><strong>Fumigation - Action</strong>: Drop a smoke bomb that fills the air within Close range with smoke, Dizzying all targets in this area. Dizzied targets have Disadvantage on their next action roll.</p>\n",
